  "limitations": [
    "Independent source-screening research only: no new model, new scene, reconstruction-ready scene or acceptance is established. R15 transfer status is unaffected and remains outside this archive.",
    "Two JPEG files are public search thumbnails, not native decoded video frames: anniversary promotional composite 1146x716 and dressing-room image 1728x1080. They were not used for modeling; the archive validates bytes and dimensions, not new scene identity.",
    "Producer records a search scope of 29 Issues (28 scene records plus research #93), with the current forest flower-island and lake leafboat additionally excluded. Reading Issue text is not complete visual deduplication of all source images.",
    "Official source chains and next viewing entries are preserved as producer research. Native multiview footage, official-use identity bridge, real 3D usage, complete visual deduplication and actual available decode quality remain unresolved. Unknown clip times are not invented.",
    "Prior failed web/binary access and authentication boundaries remain recorded. Archive worker did not browse videos, retry failed transfers, create Issues/PRs, execute source scripts, model or render.",
    "Producer tree-manifest covers six payload files. Its own exact 1170-byte SHA256 is independently pinned and checked, and all seven files plus original Git history are preserved without alteration.",
    "A new archive branch and a new original-history branch isolate this research. All preexisting remote branches and all base-tree paths remain unchanged."
